// [Mines-38.9.10 i28] living sky v7 — AGSL port of the user-approved prototype mock-mood/video2 (sky.py + yu2.py).
// GENERATED from r3910/sky/sky.agsl.in by r3910/sky/gen.py (H(#rrggbb) → half3). Segments (split by WeatherSkyCore.sources):
//   //#SHARED  uniforms, textures, camera, cloud noise, rain/aurora timing, theme grade + text guard
//   //#SKY <key>  one function `half3 skyColor(float2 p, float BH, float t)` per scene (pass 1, quarter res, p in 270-wide px)
//   //#MAIN   pass-1 entry (grade + guard)
